      <h2>Variables</h2>
      <p>Variables work in the same way as colours, but apply to other properties of components, such as a sizes.</p>
      <pre><code>// Hero
$hero-content-width--md: 60%;
$hero-content-width--lg: 60%;
$hero-image-width--md: 100%;
$hero-image-width--lg: 50%;</code></pre>
      <p>These are available in <code>/source/sass/themes/health/_variables.scss</code>.</p>
